    "preamble": "Kowthavarapu Nammaiah, vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 17 March, 2020 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition No.1548 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioner is the sole accused in Crime No.30 of 2020 of Tenali I Town Police Station, Guntur District. Prosecution in the above crime was launched against him for the offences punishable under Sections 188, 420, 270, 273, 328 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860 and under Sections 56, 57(1) and 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
